{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31461","headline":"古镜 · 李羣玉","name":"古镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月何处来，朦胧在人境。\n得非轩辕作，妙绝世莫竝。\n瑶匣开旭日，白电走孤影。\n泓澄一尺天，彻底寒霜景。\n冰辉凛毛发，使我肝胆冷。\n忽惊行深幽，面落九秋井。\n云天入掌握，爽朗神魂净。\n不必负局仙，金沙发光炯。\n阴沈蓄灵怪，可与天地永。\n恐爲悲龙吟，飞去在俄顷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}